(text "DESIGN LIMITS - NOT MAINS-CERTIFIED\nG3MB-202P DC5: AC loads only, 2 A max each; 75-264 VAC\nper datasheet. 24 VAC is outside the specified load range.\nAssume 1 oz copper and 2 mm AC tracks. Shared solenoid\nbus: 3 A total continuous; individual outputs: 2 A max.\nFit SOL_L fuse <= 3 A and 5 V fuse <= 1 A. Protect\neach load's wiring externally; select fuse breaking capacity.\nPCB rule: 6 mm AC-to-low-voltage copper; AC-to-AC class\nuses 1.5 mm for the 3.81 mm terminal pitch. Verify\ncreepage, clearance, enclosure and installation category.\nSSR GPIO drives NPN via 4.7k; no hardware base pulldowns.\nCheck off-state at boot/reset. GPIO logic is 3.3 V only.\nBoiler probe: R5 excites the ADC/probe node from GPIO17,\nR7 pulls it to GND. No 5 V tolerant ADC divider exists."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "72a6a75d-ae2b-4b9a-943d-d94a0bc6f9f8")
	)
